<title>USA: Perdigao SA Q2 is $0.13 per ADR.</title>
<headline>Perdigao SA Q2 is $0.13 per ADR.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Perdigao SA said Wednesday its second quarter 1997 consolidated sales rose to $286.5 million and its net income grew to $5.9 million, or $0.13 per ADR.</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> ADS     profit  $0.13	   loss   $0.11</p>
<p> Net     profit  5,900	   loss   4,800</p>
<p> Gross Sales     286,500		  230,400</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> ADS     profit  $0.36	   loss   $0.03</p>
<p> Net     profit  16,117	  loss   (1,401)</p>
<p> Gross sales     563,669		  447,634</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
</text>
